      "sampleParagraphZh": "将闲置的老旧厂房改造为文创园区，既避免了大拆大建带来的资源浪费，又以斑驳砖墙与钢架结构留住了城市的工业记忆。不过，若任由商业租金水涨船高，原本孕育活力的独立工作室反而会被挤出园区。只有通过政策引导保留一定比例的公益展演与青年孵化空间，工业遗产更新才能避免沦为空洞的地产噱头。",
      "sampleParagraphEn": "Converting idle factories into creative parks avoids the waste of wholesale demolition while preserving urban industrial memory through weathered brick and steel frames. Yet if commercial rents surge unchecked, the independent studios that sparked vitality get priced out. Only policy guardrails preserving public exhibition venues and youth incubators can prevent industrial renewal from becoming a hollow real-estate gimmick.",
