      "sampleParagraphZh": "移动支付极大地提升了商业结算效率，也降低了小微商户的经营门槛，其社会红利有目共睹。但在享受扫码即付便捷的同时，平台过度采集消费画像所引发的隐私焦虑亦不容忽视。完善最小必要数据采集法规，并保留现金与外卡支付等包容性通道，方能让数字金融既高效又具温度。",
      "sampleParagraphEn": "Mobile payments have dramatically accelerated commercial settlement and lowered barriers for micro-merchants, delivering clear social dividends. Yet alongside scan-and-pay convenience, privacy anxiety over excessive consumer profiling cannot be ignored. Enforcing minimum-necessary data collection rules while keeping inclusive cash and international-card channels ensures digital finance remains both efficient and humane.",
