      "sampleParagraphZh": "过去那种一天辗转数个景点的打卡式游览，往往让旅行者在疲惫奔波中错失了地方文化的真实肌理。近年来兴起的慢旅游主张放缓脚步，通过参与当地手作、品尝时令风物与社区对话来建立情感连接。尽管受限于假期长度，借助高效的高铁网络串联深度小众目的地，仍能让有限假期焕发出松弛而丰盈的质感。",
      "sampleParagraphEn": "Checklist sightseeing that rushes across multiple landmarks in a single day often leaves travelers exhausted and detached from authentic local texture. The rise of slow travel advocates unhurried exploration—joining local craft workshops, tasting seasonal fare, and conversing with residents. Even within limited vacation days, pairing fast high-speed rail links with focused regional stays allows brief trips to feel restorative and deeply rewarding.",
