      "sampleParagraphEn": "As automation and algorithms take over repetitive tasks, relying on a single early-life degree can no longer sustain a decades-long career. Lifelong learning does not require everyone to become a coder, but rather to continually refresh cross-domain literacy, collaboration, and complex judgment. Coordinated public and corporate subsidies for modular reskilling will make career transitions far smoother.",
