      "modelAnswerEn": "Cross-border supply chains and digital heritage both involve institutional rules, economic costs, and technical infrastructure. Viewing them solely through economics overlooks customs quarantine rules or platform mechanics; integrating international commercial law with data analytics yields conclusions that are both rigorous and actionable.",
      "commonPitfallToAvoidVi": "Liệt kê quá nhiều ngành không liên quan khiến hội đồng thấy bạn thiếu trọng tâm chuyên môn chính."
